  "description": "Got a little one who’s itching for their own set of wheels, but hasn’t quite mastered their balance? Set them off on this snazzy number. Designed for kids that need a little bit of support, the Raleigh Pop 14 is a kids bike that helps them to build their confidence and conquer the basics of biking, ready for that all-important day when they ditch the stabilisers and fly solo. All you need to do is cheer them on from the sidelines. The Pop range is expertly crafted for little explorers who are destined for big adventures. The 14-inch Pop weighs under 9kg, and its aluminium frame makes for a sturdy yet lightweight ride. This bike is best suited for kids aged 4-6 or are 88cm-107cm. For more detailed size breakdown and tips for measuring your child, check out our kids bike size guide.",
